263
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:38,100
We can still hear the screams of our
partners consumed by the Beastmaster.

264
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:44,000
Even if we did manage to escape, we'll
never get away from that monster.

265
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:48,400
And the weakest member of the
clan isn't going to change that.

266
00:19:53,420 --> 00:19:55,417
It'll only hurt a short while.

267
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:57,020
Soon it'll all be over.

268
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:01,760
Until then, we must clear our minds.

269
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:24,620
Three doses?

270
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:26,317
But Gato...

271
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:28,160
Toxin! Triple dose!

272
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:35,060
He's barely conscious.

273
00:20:35,860 --> 00:20:38,160
You don't know when to quit, do you?

274
00:20:38,460 --> 00:20:39,760
I mean, three doses?

275
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:43,360
After an OD like that,
you gotta hurt like hell!

276
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,353
I'll put you out of your misery, though.

277
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:54,120
All those years thinning the family herd.

278
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:57,740
For this power of slaughtering
them was worth it!

279
00:20:59,120 --> 00:21:00,420
Look out, Gato!

280
00:21:04,380 --> 00:21:06,280
I was used to eating alone.

281
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:11,200
Getting to share a meal felt really nice.

282
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:15,650
Jack!

283
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,280
An overdose means certain death.

284
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:41,377
But fighting to find a bride
has led to something unexpected.

285
00:21:41,460 --> 00:21:42,900
A mutation of sorts.

286
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:57,720
The eyesight of a falcon,
the jump of a kangaroo,

287
00:21:58,200 --> 00:22:00,420
and the deadliness of a cassowary.

288
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:04,800
I'll rip you apart before you
have time to blink! Thank you.

289
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:13,960
I want marriage.

290
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,477
I'm out of the wine.

291
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:36,917
Get this with poor liberty.

292
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:37,830
This is your love.

293
00:22:37,913 --> 00:22:39,537
If I getparado.

294
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:43,657
Should've walked away.

295
00:22:43,740 --> 00:22:44,657
Then I studied.

296
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:45,570
When I says to you.

297
00:22:45,653 --> 00:22:46,483
We're back.

298
00:22:46,566 --> 00:22:49,917
I come on.

299
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,294
You know I'm going to be good afectude.

300
00:22:52,940 --> 00:22:55,777
You know I'm going to be good
and you're going to be good.

301
00:22:55,860 --> 00:22:57,600
I'm going to be good for you.

302
00:22:58,120 --> 00:23:00,137
We are super happy and we are.

303
00:23:00,220 --> 00:23:01,102
We are too old.

304
00:23:01,420 --> 00:23:02,857
I'll be creepy.

305
00:23:02,940 --> 00:23:05,880
Oh make that noise.

306
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:08,357
I'll be creepy.

307
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:11,440
Oh make that noise.

308
00:23:12,140 --> 00:23:14,237
Dancing with you. I'm eating a mess.

309
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:15,520
I'm eating a tô.

310
00:23:33,880 --> 00:23:36,680
Thank you.

311
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:48,700
One-on-one? I don't think so.

312
00:23:48,980 --> 00:23:50,745
My bloodlust ran out ages ago.

313
00:23:51,600 --> 00:23:53,520
Blood is not a curse.

314
00:23:53,700 --> 00:23:55,620
Next time, heart and soul.
